{"3962960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "WindSail", "steam_appid": 3962960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WindSail is an online naval RPG where the wind rules everything. Read the sky, trim your sails, and carve your own path across an open sea — as a peaceful trader under a white flag, or a hunter under a black one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962960/extras/ba8be32d6ad67007dbeb0cdafde9d2b8.avif?t=1786245377\" width=615 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENGAGE IN EPIC NAVAL BATTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build unique ships and arm your fleet with deadly weapons. Unlock new types of armaments as you progress and customize your ships to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962960/extras/fa8b9e5988ab3d504186057051dafb96.avif?t=1786245377\" width=615 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE TREACHEROUS WATERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail into the open sea and discover a vast world filled with pirates, devastating storms, and unpredictable challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962960/extras/515b96e005c8d39b874178ce891a0f04.avif?t=1786245377\" width=615 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEAM UP OR FIGHT AGAINST FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join fellow pirates to complete cooperative missions and earn rewards, or dive into intense PvP and PvE battles where skill and strength decide the victor.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962960/extras/1fb049b72470c21d30bf3a3cf917f03b.avif?t=1786245377\" width=615 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENJOY EVER-GROWING CONTENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each update brings new features, dangerous threats, and fresh endgame experiences, making your pirate adventures even more thrilling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962960/extras/cdb354e86e1916269ca4adf3b6fe2642.avif?t=1786245377\" width=615 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WindSail is an online naval RPG where the wind rules everything. Read the sky, trim your sails, and carve your own path across an open sea — as a peaceful trader under a white flag, or a hunter under a black one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962960/extras/ba8be32d6ad67007dbeb0cdafde9d2b8.avif?t=1786245377\" width=615 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENGAGE IN EPIC NAVAL BATTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build unique ships and arm your fleet with deadly weapons. Unlock new types of armaments as you progress and customize your ships to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962960/extras/fa8b9e5988ab3d504186057051dafb96.avif?t=1786245377\" width=615 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE TREACHEROUS WATERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail into the open sea and discover a vast world filled with pirates, devastating storms, and unpredictable challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962960/extras/515b96e005c8d39b874178ce891a0f04.avif?t=1786245377\" width=615 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEAM UP OR FIGHT AGAINST FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join fellow pirates to complete cooperative missions and earn rewards, or dive into intense PvP and PvE battles where skill and strength decide the victor.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962960/extras/1fb049b72470c21d30bf3a3cf917f03b.avif?t=1786245377\" width=615 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENJOY EVER-GROWING CONTENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each update brings new features, dangerous threats, and fresh endgame experiences, making your pirate adventures even more thrilling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962960/extras/cdb354e86e1916269ca4adf3b6fe2642.avif?t=1786245377\" width=615 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Dive into the open world of WindSail — an online naval RPG adventure. Build and customize your fleet, craft weapons, and fight thrilling sea battles to become the most fearsome pirate and experience the full depth of pirate life in an open world.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962960/bd3cfa7e22f1504c1fabe259c705977fb322c9da/header.jpg?t=1786245377", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962960/342c85a3c82d97cde5bbdd395a8a25f6d97f3a7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786245377", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962960/342c8